{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Left Information Capsule:** Choose from multiple unique glass styles (Classic, Glass, Split, Liquid Glass) with modules for Time/Date, Carrier, Weather, Music, Battery, Calendar and Volume.\n- **Right Area & Duo Orbit:** A tidy status ring showing Wi-Fi, cellular signal, 5G/LTE and Battery. Supports per-element color changes and independent VPN customization.\n- **Mini Dock Bar:** A quick app tray holding 4 to 8 pinned or recently opened apps, letting you open apps directly from the status bar.\n- **Detailed Customization & Interaction:** Customize background color, animated battery outline, Bluetooth alerts, and set separate configurations for the Lock Screen, Home Screen, Control Center or In-App.",
